Dear Mr. Patdu,

Good day.

Please see attached file quotation for your reference and send your samples
thru courier of your choice and address to :

Christy Jane S. Tizon / Angelica Rose S. Lallo
Department of Science and Technology - Philippine Textile Research Institute
Room 101, TSD Receiving Office
General Santos Ave. Upper Bicutan Taguig City
Tel: 8837-1158
Cp No. 09166389760


Please see attached guide on how to do the sampling for tensile strength,
single strand and fiber fineness.


note po dapat dry sample nyo.



Tensile Strength (Single Strand)


 paki dikit ang c-template sa folder bago i cut isa isa, pag nadikit na sa
folder at na cut na dikitan ang isa isang c-template ng isang strand of
fiber (straight ang fiber pag dinikit).


Note: 35pcs  c-template gawin.



pero wag po masking tape gamitin nyo po kundi glue nalang kasi dumidikit po
sa machine ang masking tape.



Warm Regards, Christy








You may contact us for further queries. Thank you for trusting DOST-PTRI
for your testing and analysis needs.

We are looking forward to our next transaction.

Christy Jane S. Tizon / Angelica Rose S. Lallo
*PTRI Testing Laboratory Receiving and Releasing Office*
Department of Science and Technology
*Philippine Textile Research Institute *
General Santos Ave. Bicutan Taguig City
Tel: 8837-1158
Cp No. 09166389760

*Advisory:*

*DOST PTRI is open from Monday to Friday **with office hours from 8:00 am
to 5:00 pm. *
*We are closed on Weekends and Public Holidays.*

NOTE:

*To claim the Test Report - Bring the Test Request.  *

